Cell["\<\
If we will not use ExtendOutermorphismToBasisElements\[Rule]True, then wrong \
common factor is due to how we interpret action on outer product!!!\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.797158921840695*^9, 3.7971589491080103`*^9}, {
  3.7971590292803926`*^9, 3.797159072632703*^9}, {3.797242775880748*^9, 
