Cell["\<\
Assume that rotor is just a scalar + bivector. Then formula is true for \
Cl(3,0). For higher algebras and signatures it is not true. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d9c62f16-cb81-4956-a524-3aec48a4e722"],

