Cell["\<\
If we don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t not use \
ExtendOutermorphismToBasisElements\[Rule]True, we obtain wrong common factor. \
Thus  is due to  our different  interpretation of action on outer product!!!\
\>", "Text",
