Cell["\<\
Warning here is a some specific: we want explicitly to require that help \
adjoint MV would contain all grades (since the argument is a scalar) This \
test now was included in gaAdjointTransformation[ ] function\
\>", "Text",
 CellGroupingRules->{"GroupTogetherGrouping", 10000.},
